		(uuid "934ddd73-baa1-4a4c-9d80-635cef068ba8")
	)
	(text "this is a hybrid compressor:\n--------------------------------\nthe envelope of the audio that is used to calculate gain reduction\nis created by analog components. then that envelope is read into\na ADC on the STM32, and digitally, the gain reduction is calculated\nfrom the audio dyanmic envelope and the user's attack, release,\nthreshold and ratio settings. then, that gain reduction is turned\ninto a control voltage and sent back to analog with a DAC on the\nSTM32, and that gain reduction / compression is actually applied\nin analog with VCAs. (this is a vca compressor with a hybrid\ndigital/analog sidechain)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 203.454 120.65 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "a465fc80-dcbe-45ea-a4c8-cd97e7ba7575")
	)
	(text "U1"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 48.26 180.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ab01bfc1-007e-4e48-b0eb-d39e903a1e50")
	)
	(text "ADC (ENV_ADC), sample >= 20 kHz:\n  level_dBu = 20 log10( V / 0.2421 )\n\nDAC (GR_DAC), output buffer ON:\n  V = (0.2685 + 0.0061 x G_dB) / 0.2053\n  G = -40...+20 dB (cut and make-up), 0 dB = 1.308 V\n\nVREF+: R7 = 78.7k x VREF/3.3, R5\n  = 22.1k x VREF/3.3(3.0 V: R7 71.5k, R5 20.0k)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 213.36 27.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ba1e60a2-a0fb-4203-acdc-1ab74b589bd5")
	)
	(text "U1"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 38.1 180.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c37902db-04a3-42ee-aa0d-eb8a7af97644")
	)
	(text "COMP_CV = 0.2685 - 0.2053 x GR_DAC  (DAC FS 2.048 V, 6.1 mV/dB)\nDAC 0.119 V = -40 dB, 1.308 V = 0 dB, 1.902 V = +20 dB; 16.8 mdB/LSB.\nDAC 0 V (reset, R11) = -44 dB: a failure always cuts, never boosts.\nMFB: 8.0 kHz, Q 0.72."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 34.29 143.51 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c962532b-c8f9-47ed-8666-1d4e159d3572")
	)
	(text "ENV_ADC = 0.221 x |DET_IN|: +22 dBu sine = 3.05 V peak, -30 dBu = 9.5 LSB peak.\nR6/C2: 3.4 kHz anti-alias for fs >= 20 kHz. Peak/RMS, attack and release in firmware."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 36.576 91.694 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "cfa4af63-e5a0-409c-ae37-bc7cb1125735")
	)
